
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GOLDEN HILLS</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/results/template-9.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>

	<style>
		.passport{
			height:120px;
			width:100px;
			border:solid 1px black;
			background: url('<%= student.passport %>');
			background-repeat: no-repeat;
			background-size:cover;
			background-position: center;
    
		}		
	</style>
</head>
	<body>
		<div class="no-print flex justify-center gap-2 p-4 print:hidden">

			<a
				href="/result/<%= result._id %>/pdf"
				class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-slate-700"
			>
				Download PDF
			</a>

			<a
				href="/result/<%= result._id %>/image"
				class="rounded-lg bg-teal-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-teal-700"
			>
				Download Image
			</a>

			<button
				onclick="window.print()"
				class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50"
			>
				Print
			</button>

		</div>
		<div id="resultContainer">
			<div class="school">
				<div class="logo"></div>
				<div class="school-info">
					<div class="school-name">
						<h1><%= school.schoolName?.toUpperCase() %></h1>
					</div>
					<div class="address-info">
						<div class="address"><%=school.address %></div>
						<div class="contact">Tel: <%=school.phone%></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="passport"></div>
			</div>	
			
			
			<div class="sudent-info">
				<div><%= result.class %> <%=student.house %>, <%= result.term %> RESULT <%= result.section %> ACADEMIC SESSION</div>
				<p>NAME OF PUPIL : <u><span><%= result.fullname.toUpperCase() %></span></u> <!--SEX: <span><u>FEMALE</u></span> --> D.O.B: <span><u><%= result.dob %></u></span></p>
				<P>TOTAL MARKS SCORE: <span><u> <%= result.score_obtain %></u></span> OUT OF: <span><u><%= result.score_obtainable %></u></span> AVERAGE: <span><u><%= result.average %></u></span> CLASS: <span><u><%= result.studentClass.toUpperCase() %></u></span></P>
				<P>ADMISSSION NO.: <span><u><%= student.addmissionNo %></u></span> NO. OF TIMES PRESENT: <span><u><%= result.present %></u></span> NO OF TIMES ABSENT: <span><u><%= result.absent %></u></span></P>
			</div>
			
